flowchart TB
  Owner[Владелец source] --> Browser[Browser: local draft]
  Browser --> Web[Existing web: owner API и Original Range]
  Web --> DB[(PostgreSQL: clip, intent, seed, attempts)]
  Web --> Queue[(Existing render queue)]
  Queue --> Worker[Existing worker-video]
  Worker --> DB
  Worker --> S3[S3: source и immutable MP4]
  Web --> S3
  subgraph Presentation[Компоненты browser]
    Choice[ClipLayoutChoice] --> Preview[ClipLayoutPreview]
  end
  Browser --> Choice
  subgraph Rendering[Компоненты worker]
    Dispatch[Render dispatch] --> Seed[Bounded seed handler]
    Dispatch --> Render[Existing render pipeline]
    Render --> Graph[Screen compositor]
    Render --> Publish[Fenced publish]
  end
  Worker --> Dispatch
  Shared[Shared geometry и cut timeline] --> Preview
  Shared --> Graph
